<title>POLAND: Lubawa expects '97 net up to PLN 2.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Lubawa expects '97 net up to PLN 2.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish technical garment maker Lubawa SA expects to lift its 1997 net profit to 2.7 million zlotys from 1.9 million last year, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
